WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:11,020
Did they not say this was a bookshop?

2
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:26,460
This whole setup is a mess

3
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:28,460
You insisted on seeing her yourself

4
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:30,000
What time is it already?

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,500
We have not even seen a shadow of Young Master Xu, Mother

6
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:35,500
Marriage is for a lifetime

7
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:37,910
I have to choose carefully

8
00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:39,410
You are eighteen and still choosing?

9
00:00:39,410 --> 00:00:40,710
How many is this now?

10
00:00:40,710 --> 00:00:42,410
The first — too short, you said

11
00:00:42,410 --> 00:00:46,550
The second — like a bamboo pole, said Nanny Zhou

12
00:00:46,550 --> 00:00:48,050
Come, let us look downstairs

13
00:00:48,050 --> 00:00:49,150
Why is Matchmaker Wang not here yet?

14
00:00:49,150 --> 00:00:50,350
Hey, wait here

15
00:00:50,350 --> 00:00:58,530
Do not wander off, Young Lord

16
00:00:58,530 --> 00:00:59,770
The Madam held an Autumn Banquet

17
00:00:59,770 --> 00:01:01,270
to arrange a matchmaking for you

18
00:01:01,270 --> 00:01:02,670
So we hid here at Yundu Tavern

19
00:01:02,670 --> 00:01:05,130
Finally, some peace. Come with me

20
00:01:05,130 --> 00:01:06,130
You keep watch outside

21
00:01:06,130 --> 00:01:32,140
So this is my destiny

22
00:01:32,140 --> 00:01:34,140
Young Master Xu, right? I am Song Yu

23
00:01:34,140 --> 00:01:35,640
the Yu that is desired but never attained

24
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:39,380
You have the wrong room, miss

25
00:01:39,380 --> 00:01:40,380
I am not—

26
00:01:40,380 --> 00:01:43,210
Even the way you speak is lovely

27
00:01:44,070 --> 00:01:46,810
Matchmaker Wang must have told you my terms. Sit.

28
00:01:46,810 --> 00:01:48,720
Standing is tiring

29
00:01:48,720 --> 00:01:52,920
This girl mistook me for her matchmaking date — fine

30
00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:55,160
it saves Mother from nagging me to marry

31
00:01:55,160 --> 00:01:56,360
If she is suitable

32
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:58,380
then I will simply play along

33
00:01:58,380 --> 00:01:59,380
What terms?
